WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,020
Where can I help you find Master Ye?

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:04,020
Stop talking nonsense

3
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:05,020
Can't find the leaf master

4
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:06,020
Then it starts next month

5
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:09,020
You rent all the remaining vacant rooms in the community yourself.

6
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:11,020
I rent so many rooms all by myself

7
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:15,020
Then how much rent do I have to pay per month, Brother Yuan?

8
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:18,020
You might as well just grab it.

9
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:19,020
What nonsense?

10
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:22,020
Are you, Brother Yuan, that kind of person who steals money?

11
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:24,020
Is it quick to steal the money and let me collect the rent?

12
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:26,020
Find me Master Ye quickly

13
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:28,750
Zheng Ghost Bureau

14
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:31,750
Can you guys come and take care of this black-hearted security guard?

15
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:34,750
The ghost doctor’s life is also his life
